      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I saw a post on my Google feed about windows messing with GPU drivers. I didn't read it, but in the past windows update has downgraded drivers in the name of stability. Great if you use the computer for not-gaming, but bad for games.\n\nIf the problem is wide spread other people will have trouble and will be able to figure out the cause.",
