  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "There are no steps to reproduce the bug that I know of besides opening VRChat and entering an instance. The first sign of the bug happening is when your mic UI has a trail when you look around (which is the picture below). When you press ESC, the quick menu doesn't show up, but the game acts like the menu's there because you can't look around with the mouse. The menu is not invisible because I've tried clicking at random around the screen and nothing was prompted. I've restarted, verified files, and reinstalled the game. This bug happens at random times; however, it happens everytime I open VRChat ever since a week ago.",
